## Alpha promotion ~every 2 weeks: alpha ← dev code only (dev characters stay dev).
## systemd has no native "every 14 days", so we fire on the 1st and 15th —
## a clean, predictable biweekly cadence. 02:00 UTC, before the beta/live runs.
[Unit]
Description=Cryptic Realm — biweekly alpha promotion (1st & 15th)
Requires=cryptic-realm-promote@alpha.service

[Timer]
OnCalendar=*-*-01,15 02:00:00 UTC
Persistent=true
Unit=cryptic-realm-promote@alpha.service

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
